# Build output.
/target

# Rendered takes. The repo carries a couple of example videos on purpose, so
# they are re-admitted below rather than the pattern being narrowed: a take
# recorded while debugging should never be committable by accident.
*.mp4
!examples/kaviri-readme.mp4

# The telemetry sidecar written next to a take. It carries every URL the take
# visited, including query strings and canonicalised local file:// paths, so
# it stays out of the repo even when the video beside it does not.
*.telemetry.json
!examples/kaviri-readme.mp4.telemetry.json

# The render intermediate. Modern runs put it under the system temp directory
# with a per-run suffix, but --keep-temp and older builds leave one beside the
# output, so the pattern has to match the suffixed form as well as the bare name.
.kaviri-tmp*

# Editor and OS droppings.
.DS_Store
*.swp
